    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to bring to the market 1 Cronan Park, Shannon, a spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace home ideally located within this mature and well-established residential area.\n\nThis property offers excellent potential for buyers looking to create a home to their own taste and style. While the house would benefit from some modernisation and upgrading, this presents an exciting opportunity for a new owner to put their own stamp on the property and create a home that suits their individual needs.\n\nThe accommodation is generously proportioned throughout, with three good-sized bedrooms providing excellent living space for a growing family, first-time buyers or those looking for a property with plenty of potential. The end-of-terrace position also adds to the appeal of the property.\n\nCronan Park is a mature and popular residential area, conveniently located within Shannon and close to a range of local amenities, including schools, shops, sporting facilities and public transport links. The property's location also provides easy access to Shannon Town Centre and the surrounding areas.\n\n1 Cronan Park represents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a spacious home in a well-established location, with the added benefit of being able to modernise and personalise the property to their own requirements.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space and potential this property has to offer."
      },
